      {
        "question_text": "An amount of $\\$6000$ is invested at $5\\%$ p.a. simple interest for $4$ years. Make a table of its total value from time $0$ to year $4$, then draw a graph showing how the investment value changes.",
        "solution_text": "Yearly interest $=6000\\times0.05=\\$300$.\nAdd $\\$300$ each year to the investment value.\n\n| Time (years) | Investment value (dollars) |\n| --- | --- |\n| 0 | 6000 |\n| 1 | 6300 |\n| 2 | 6600 |\n| 3 | 6900 |\n| 4 | 7200 |\n\nPlot the table values and join them with a straight line. The graph starts at the principal, $\\$6000$, and rises by the same amount each year.\n\n[tikz]\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=14mm,y=0.008mm]\n\\definecolor{investmentBlue}{HTML}{268CFF}\n\\definecolor{gridGrey}{HTML}{CCCCCC}\n\\draw[color=gridGrey,line width=0.3pt,xstep=14mm,ystep=12mm] (0,0) grid (4,7500);\n\\draw[->,color=black,line width=0.6pt] (0,0)--(4.35,0);\n\\draw[->,color=black,line width=0.6pt] (0,0)--(0,7900);\n\\foreach \\t in {0,1,2,3,4} {\n  \\draw[color=black] (\\t,0)--(\\t,-100);\n  \\path (\\t,-100) node[below,text=black,font=\\fontsize{8.5}{10}\\selectfont] {\\t};\n}\n\\foreach \\v in {1500,3000,4500,6000,7500} {\n  \\draw[color=black] (0,\\v)--(-0.07,\\v);\n  \\path (-0.07,\\v) node[left,text=black,font=\\fontsize{8.5}{10}\\selectfont] {\\v};\n}\n\\path (2,-650) node[below,text=black,font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont] {Time (years)};\n\\path (-0.95,3750) node[rotate=90,text=black,font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont] {Investment value (\\$)};\n\\draw[color=investmentBlue,line width=1pt] (0,6000)--(4,7200);\n\\foreach \\t/\\v in {0/6000,1/6300,2/6600,3/6900,4/7200} {\n  \\fill[color=investmentBlue] (\\t,\\v) circle[radius=1.5pt];\n}\n\\end{tikzpicture}\n[/tikz]"
      }
    ],
